83	    83	    /// upgrades the connection with no body to read first, as a `CONNECT` request. The parser
84	    84	    /// completes the message, and pauses at the upgrade when it is one.
85	    85	    Upgrade,
86	    86	    /// A body in chunks, `Transfer-Encoding: chunked`, whatever its `Content-Length` (`2`).
87	    87	    Chunked,
