230	   230	    /// first (RFC 2616, 4.4), then the response to a `HEAD` request, a chunked
231	   231	    /// `Transfer-Encoding`, which overrides a `Content-Length`, any other
232	   232	    /// `Transfer-Encoding`, and the `Content-Length`.
233	   233	    ///
