344	   344	    /// run: returns whether another message may follow on the same connection
345	   345	    /// ([`should_keep_alive`](ParserRef::should_keep_alive)), then marks the parser safe to
346	   346	    /// finish, `HTTP_FINISH_SAFE`, and clears the message's flags for the next.
